sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    actor STW as Data Protection Steward
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AccessLogsController
    participant S as AccessLogService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Open own access log (date range, role)
    W->>C: GET /api/AccessLogs/me?fromDate&toDate&roleName
    C->>S: GetMyAccessLogsAsync(StudentId, request)
    S-->>W: Who read which attribute, when and under which purpose
    STU->>W: Flag an entry
    W->>C: PUT /api/AccessLogs/me/{id}/flag
    C->>S: FlagMineAsync(StudentId, AccessLogId)
    S->>R: UpdateAsync(isFlagged = true, status = unreviewed)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACCESSLOGS (review fields only)
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(every Steward)
    STW->>W: Open flagged entries
    W->>C: GET /api/AccessLogs/search?isFlagged=true
    STW->>W: Mark as cleared (or confirmedIssue)
    W->>C: PUT /api/AccessLogs/{id}/review {status}
    C->>S: ReviewAsync(AccessLogId, request)
    S->>R: UpdateAsync(status, reviewedBy, reviewedAt)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACCESSLOGS
    C-->>W: 200 OK
